From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3d11: CreateDirect3D11DeviceFromDXGIDevice and CreateDirect3D11SurfaceFromDXGISurface

Forward the WinRT interop exports to Wine's sgd3dinterop.dll (wine-sg 7854), which implements
them once for Wine's d3d11.dll and this one: a DXGI device or surface wrapped as the WinRT
IDirect3DDevice / IDirect3DSurface (with IDirect3DDxgiInterfaceAccess and IClosable) that
Windows.Graphics.Capture clients take. OBS's, PotPlayer's and Zoom's capture plugins import them.
---
diff --git a/src/d3d11/d3d11.def b/src/d3d11/d3d11.def
index d406ba0..6db9b2d 100644
--- a/src/d3d11/d3d11.def
+++ b/src/d3d11/d3d11.def
@@ -4,3 +4,5 @@ EXPORTS
     D3D11CreateDevice @22
     D3D11CreateDeviceAndSwapChain @23
     D3D11On12CreateDevice @24
+    CreateDirect3D11DeviceFromDXGIDevice = sgd3dinterop.CreateDirect3D11DeviceFromDXGIDevice
+    CreateDirect3D11SurfaceFromDXGISurface = sgd3dinterop.CreateDirect3D11SurfaceFromDXGISurface
